# Weekly dreaming reports — tracked so the [applied YYYY-MM-DD] annotation
# history survives across machines. Same convention as ~/wrk/common.
#.claude/dreaming/reports/   ← intentionally NOT ignored
# Run log only (per-machine scratch, not part of the report) — already
# caught by the blanket *.log rule above, listed here for clarity.
.claude/dreaming/reports/.dreaming.log

# throwaway scratch (dev helpers live in minions/, which IS tracked)
tmp/

# engagement-specific notes — local only, never published
.engage/
